            "review_title": "Review at Bep Quan",
            "review_text": "Sightsee22746278205\n1 contribution\n0\nToo bad\nAug 2023 • Family\nA very bad experience here yesterday, out of 4 meat dishes, 2 were very bad, the first was beef with black pepper sauce, thinly sliced beef, about 2 fingers, somewhere around 10 pieces. small, the rest is onions, followed by cheese baked shrimp, bland, cold, only 5 small shrimp, the price is too expensive compared to the products and services chosen, people should consider when entering here it is! Rated 1 star only\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten August 29, 2023",
